fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4125436Z Note: a multi-user installation is possible. See https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/installation/installing-binary.html#multi-user-installation
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4137813Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4242875Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4252982Z ^[[0m
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4254041Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4254997Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4255443Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4255838Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4257429Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4258043Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4258494Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4259186Z    if you are ready to continue.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4259414Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4259912Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4260524Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4261206Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4261601Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4261790Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4262083Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4262367Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4262589Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4262996Z    can use Nix.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4264306Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4264581Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4264966Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4265587Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4266535Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4267030Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4267590Z I will:
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4267910Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4268292Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4269321Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4270110Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4270797Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4271123Z  - install Nix in /nix
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4271440Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4271889Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4272336Z    /root
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4283642Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4284519Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4296113Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4296927Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4297225Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4301204Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mReady to continue?
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4301919Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4317912Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4318697Z ^[[34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4330230Z ^[[0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4331184Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4331924Z run in a headless fashion, like this:
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4332290Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4332608Z   $ curl -L https://nixos.org/nix/install | sh
