fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4334070Z or maybe in a CI pipeline. Because of that, I'm going to skip the
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4334940Z verbose output in the interest of brevity.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4335330Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4335526Z If you would like to
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4335993Z see the output, try like this:
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:30.4336317Z 
