creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5499999Z Note: a multi-user installation is possible. See https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/installation/installing-binary.html#multi-user-installation
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5516231Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5584662Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5592739Z ^[[0m
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5592993Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5593340Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5593507Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5594127Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5594480Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5594689Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5594838Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5595239Z    if you are ready to continue.
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5595376Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5595647Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5596046Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5596425Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5596718Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5596858Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5596993Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5597188Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5597335Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5597630Z    can use Nix.
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5597728Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5597808Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5597896Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5599469Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5599893Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5604535Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5604620Z I will:
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5604713Z 
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5604807Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5605015Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5605391Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5605688Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5605938Z  - install Nix in /nix
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5606147Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5606452Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
creation	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T19:59:29.5606694Z    /root
